{"track":"r","id":"r-005","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"단어 순서 뒤집기","desc":"<p>공백으로 구분된 문장에서 <b>단어의 순서</b>를 뒤집는 <code>reverse_words(sentence)</code>를 만드세요. 예: <code>\"hello world\"</code> → <code>\"world hello\"</code></p>","starter":"reverse_words <- function(sentence) {\n}\n","solution":"reverse_words <- function(sentence) {\n  words <- strsplit(sentence, \" \")[[1]]\n  paste(rev(words), collapse = \" \")\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>strsplit()</code>으로 쪼개고, <code>rev()</code>로 뒤집고, <code>paste(..., collapse = \" \")</code>로 다시 합쳐요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"reverse_words(\"hello world\")","expected":"world hello","visible":true},{"call":"reverse_words(\"a b c\")","expected":"c b a","visible":true},{"call":"reverse_words(\"single\")","expected":"single","visible":false},{"call":"reverse_words(\"one two three four\")","expected":"four three two one","visible":false}]}